      "resampling_boundary": "Each already average-referenced/demeaned 2-second window independently resampled with a fixed zero-phase antialias FIR; reflection uses only that window; recenter output within that window. No adjacent-window or record-wide statistics. This is window-offline, not causal sample-by-sample filtering.",
