      "bridge_interpretation": "500-Hz reference uses original NFFT=1024; grid control uses NFFT=1000, matching 128-Hz NFFT=256 frequency spacing of 0.5 Hz. Both zero-padding grid and resampling can change DE. CNN uses broadband time samples whereas DE uses 4-30 Hz, so this compares representations as well as classifiers.",
      "candidates": {
