      "implementation": "Local PyTorch EEGNet-8,2; author architecture and Braindecode parameter semantics checked. PyTorch default initialization; no numerical-equivalence claim. Spatial max-norm=1, classifier max-norm=0.25 after each optimizer step. Ordinary Dropout; ELU; mean pooling 4/8; BN eps=0.001 and momentum=0.01.",
      "training": {
        "optimizer": "Adam",
        "learning_rate": 0.001,
        "weight_decay": 0.0,
        "batch_size": 128,
        "max_epochs": 60,
        "patience": 12,
        "min_epochs": 15,
        "threads": 2
      },
      "compute_deviation": "Planning draft suggested 150 epochs/patience20 and preferred Braindecode. Before real stage3 results, synthetic CPU timing was about 0.50 s/1440-window epoch at4 threads or0.75 s at2; no CUDA available. Freeze a bounded first EEGNet comparison at60 epochs/patience12 with three seeds and all36 targets. A direct PyTorch implementation keeps the training/state audit small. No outcome-driven architecture/seed selection.",
      "sampling": "Every source subject/condition has30 nonoverlapping windows. Seeded permutation once per epoch, all samples used, no replacement, no dropped tail. Equal total weight per subject and condition; no augmentation.",
      "standardization": "One mean/std per channel over current source-training windows and time samples (ddof0); scale<=1e-12 replaced with1. Inner validation/outer target never fit a scaler. Store final means/stds and source IDs.",
      "early_stopping": "Per inner fold: mean of validation-subject BA, first strict improvement >1e-12; stop when epoch>=15 and12 epochs without improvement; cap60. Select median of three best epochs, then initialize from scratch on all35 sources with base seed for that many epochs.",
      "seed_schedule": "Inner fold RNG=base_seed+10000*(fold_index+1); final RNG=base_seed. Deterministic algorithms enabled; each task has a separate process. Reproducibility is limited to this software/hardware environment.",
      "evaluation": "Threshold arithmetic probability>=0.5. eval() plus inference_mode; assert all parameters and buffers unchanged. No target labels passed into fitting or inference; only evaluator consumes labels after predictions.",
      "aggregation": "Report all36 participants for each of3 seeds. Primary CNN descriptive mean: per-participant average of the3 seed-specific BA, then participant mean. Seed variability is not extra participants. Probability-ensemble score optional and separately labelled, not primary.",
      "smoke_subjects": [
        "Subject00",
        "Subject17",
        "Subject35"
      ],
      "smoke_seed": 42,
      "failure_policy": "Failed folds saved explicitly; no predictions substituted, no aggregate over only successful folds. Completed fold reuse requires matching config, data, source and environment fingerprint plus output hashes.",
      "interpretation": "Exploratory on the same36-subject dataset; no confirmatory significance or guaranteed improvement. Report budget-cap hits and source training/validation curves.",
